This product ports algorithms and data from the following projects.

pele (https://github.com/obsidianmd/pele)
Copyright (c) 2026 kepano
Licensed under the MIT License.
fermaid follows pele v1.9.0 (commit e7f092a4de147cc32210913c20e36eaa5fcd0ef1).
Ported from it: the preprocessing rules (comments, front matter and its YAML
subset, init directives, entity codes), the label layout and wrapping rules,
the Arial text metrics tables and measuring rules, the SVG theming scheme,
the layout algorithms, and the default input and output limits.

Mermaid (https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid)
Copyright (c) 2014-2022 Knut Sveidqvist
Licensed under the MIT License.
fermaid targets the diagram syntax of Mermaid 12.1.0 and uses Mermaid's parser
specifications as test cases.

